      "id": "packages_store_redis_claude_scan_unlink_cleanup",
      "label": "SCAN/UNLINK Keyspace Cleanup",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "rationale": "clear() and family cleanup page with SCAN and delete with UNLINK when available, falling back to KEYS/DEL only for a minimal client, so KEYS is never called on a shared Redis instance when scan is available.",
      "source_file": "packages/store-redis/CLAUDE.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null
    },
    {
      "id": "packages_store_redis_claude_live_pttl_reset",
      "label": "Live PTTL Rate-Limit Reset",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "rationale": "RedisRateLimitStore derives resetAt from live PTTL instead of Date.now() + windowMs so RateLimit-Reset and Retry-After headers do not slide forward on every hit.",
      "source_file": "packages/store-redis/CLAUDE.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null
    },
    {
      "id": "packages_store_redis_claude_lua_refresh_rotation",
      "label": "Single-Trip Lua Refresh Rotation",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "rationale": "RedisRefreshTokenStore.consume executes read, delete, and family tombstone creation in one Lua round trip so a token replay revokes the entire family.",
      "source_file": "packages/store-redis/CLAUDE.md",
      "source_location": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null
    },
    {
      "id": "packages_store_redis_claude_idempotent_shared_close",
      "label": "Idempotent Shared Client Disposal",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "rationale": "Every store exposes idempotent close() and Symbol.asyncDispose; a shared client is released once unless closeClient: false is stated, and cache writes without a lifetime persist without EX.",
      "source_file": "packages/store-redis/CLAUDE.md",
      "source_location": null,
